{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash Complete API Reference (OpenAI-Compatible)",
    "description": "Complete API reference for the MiniMax-M3.1-Flash chat interface.\n\n**Preview model**: MiniMax-M3.1-Flash is a preview release. Its behavior and parameters may change.\n\n**Model Capabilities**:\n- Positioning: MiniMax's fast model for day-to-day coding and agent workflows\n- Context window: **1,000,000 tokens** (1M)\n- Maximum output: **524,288 tokens** (512K), recommended up to **131,072 tokens** (128K)\n- Thinking: Always on and cannot be turned off; set the depth with `reasoning_effort` (default `max`)\n- Multimodal input: Supports text, images, and video\n- Tool calling: Supports Function Calling\n- Streaming output: Supports SSE streaming responses",
    "license": {
      "name": "MIT"
    },
    "version": "1.0.0"
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://direct.evolink.ai",
      "description": "Production (Recommended)"
    },
    {
      "url": "https://api.evolink.ai",
      "description": "Alternative URL"
    }
  ],
  "security": [
    {
      "bearerAuth": []
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/v1/chat/completions": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash Chat Interface (OpenAI-Compatible)",
        "description": "**Preview model**: MiniMax-M3.1-Flash is a preview release. Its behavior and parameters may change.\n\n- Use the OpenAI Chat Completions protocol to call the MiniMax-M3.1-Flash model\n- **Multi-turn conversation**: Supports single-turn or multi-turn contextual dialogue\n- **System prompts**: Customize AI role and behavior via `role=system` messages\n- **Multimodal input**: `content` supports mixed text + image / video\n- **Thinking**: Always on; set the depth with `reasoning_effort`. Thinking is returned in `reasoning_content`, separate from the answer in `content`\n- **Streaming output**: Supports SSE streaming responses; thinking arrives in `delta.reasoning_content` and the answer in `delta.content`\n- **Tool calling**: Supports Function Calling\n\n**Thinking and the output-token limit**:\n- Thinking cannot be turned off. Thinking tokens are billed as output tokens and count toward `max_completion_tokens`\n- If no output-token limit is set, EvoLink uses **32768**\n- With a small limit and a high `reasoning_effort`, thinking can use up the whole limit: the response ends with `finish_reason: \"length\"` and an empty `content`. Keep the limit at 32768 or higher, and lower `reasoning_effort` for simple tasks\n- In multi-turn tool calling, send back the full assistant message, including `reasoning_content` and `tool_calls`\n\n**Compatibility rules**:\n\n| Request | EvoLink handling |\n| --- | --- |\n| `thinking.type: \"disabled\"` | `thinking` is removed; if `reasoning_effort` is not set, it is set to `low` |\n| `reasoning_effort: \"none\"` / `\"minimal\"` | Changed to `low` |\n| `reasoning_split: false` | Removed; thinking is always returned in `reasoning_content` |\n| `service_tier` | Removed; requests always use the standard tier |\n\nWhatever `thinking` or `reasoning_effort` value you send, thinking still runs and its tokens are billed as output.\n\n**Ignored parameters**: `presence_penalty`, `frequency_penalty`, `logit_bias`. `n` only supports `1`.",
        "operationId": "createChatCompletionMiniMaxM31Flash",
        "tags": [
          "Chat Completion"
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ChatCompletionRequest"
              },
              "examples": {
                "simple_text": {
                  "summary": "Single-turn text conversation",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash",
                    "messages": [
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": "Please introduce yourself"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "multi_turn": {
                  "summary": "Multi-turn conversation (context understanding)",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash",
                    "messages": [
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": "What is Python?"
                      },
                      {
                        "role": "assistant",
                        "content": "Python is a high-level programming language..."
                      },
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": "What are its advantages?"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "system_prompt": {
                  "summary": "Using system prompts",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash",
                    "messages": [
                      {
                        "role": "system",
                        "content": "You are a professional Python programming assistant. Answer questions concisely."
                      },
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": "How to read a file?"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "reasoning_effort": {
                  "summary": "Set thinking depth (reasoning_effort)",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash",
                    "reasoning_effort": "medium",
                    "max_completion_tokens": 32768,
                    "messages": [
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": "Find the bug in this function: def add(a, b): return a - b"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "image_understanding": {
                  "summary": "Image understanding (multimodal input)",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash",
                    "messages": [
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": [
                          {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": "What is in this image?"
                          },
                          {
                            "type": "image_url",
                            "image_url": {
                              "url": "https://example.com/image.jpeg"
                            }
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ],
                    "max_completion_tokens": 32768
                  }
                },
                "video_understanding": {
                  "summary": "Video understanding (multimodal input)",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash",
                    "messages": [
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": [
                          {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": "Describe what happens in this video."
                          },
                          {
                            "type": "video_url",
                            "video_url": {
                              "url": "https://example.com/video.mp4",
                              "fps": 1
                            }
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ],
                    "max_completion_tokens": 32768
                  }
                },
                "tool_calling": {
                  "summary": "Function Calling (tool invocation)",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash",
                    "messages": [
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": "Check the weather in Beijing today"
                      }
                    ],
                    "tools": [
                      {
                        "type": "function",
                        "function": {
                          "name": "get_weather",
                          "description": "Query weather conditions for a specified city",
                          "parameters": {
                            "type": "object",
                            "properties": {
                              "location": {
                                "type": "string",
                                "description": "City name, e.g.: Beijing"
                              }
                            },
                            "required": [
                              "location"
                            ]
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "tool_result": {
                  "summary": "Send back the tool result (multi-turn tool calling)",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash",
                    "messages": [
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": "Check the weather in Beijing today"
                      },
                      {
                        "role": "assistant",
                        "content": "",
                        "reasoning_content": "The user wants to check the weather in Beijing, calling the get_weather tool.",
                        "tool_calls": [
                          {
                            "id": "call_function_p4iiqtpnh5bj_1",
                            "type": "function",
                            "function": {
                              "name": "get_weather",
                              "arguments": "{\"location\": \"Beijing\"}"
                            }
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "role": "tool",
                        "tool_call_id": "call_function_p4iiqtpnh5bj_1",
                        "content": "{\"location\": \"Beijing\", \"weather\": \"Sunny\", \"temperature\": \"22°C\"}"
                      }
                    ],
                    "tools": [
                      {
                        "type": "function",
                        "function": {
                          "name": "get_weather",
                          "description": "Query weather conditions for a specified city",
                          "parameters": {
                            "type": "object",
                            "properties": {
                              "location": {
                                "type": "string",
                                "description": "City name, e.g.: Beijing"
                              }
                            },
                            "required": [
                              "location"
                            ]
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "streaming": {
                  "summary": "Streaming output",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash",
                    "stream": true,
                    "stream_options": {
                      "include_usage": true
                    },
                    "messages": [
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": "Write a short poem about spring"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
